From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] shell: tolerate duplicate shared Activity removal

Salut can deliver a removal signal after Neighborhood has already discarded
the corresponding shared Activity.  The shell model is the authoritative
owner of the shared-activity color map, so removal must be idempotent at this
boundary as well as in the Neighborhood view.

--- a/src/jarabe/model/shell.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/model/shell.py
@@ -518,1 +518,1 @@
-        del self._shared_activities[activity_id]
+        self._shared_activities.pop(activity_id, None)
